# imajev-2b (mindchain, Qwen3.5 vision decision model) as a decision model on Ollama's
# /v1/systemone. Pull the weights first (the user runs this):
#   ollama pull hf.co/mindchain/imajev-2b-GGUF:Q8_0
# Then: ollama create imajev:2b -f modelfiles/imajev-2b.Modelfile
# As for winnow (winnow-ollama-e4b.Modelfile): the CAPABILITY lines make /v1/systemone
# accept it, and Ollama builds the decision prompt itself, not in imajev's lettered
# options. Its card's calibration temperature (1.305) is not applied.
FROM hf.co/mindchain/imajev-2b-GGUF:Q8_0
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
CAPABILITY decision
CAPABILITY vision
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
